# Deployment Order — Versions 15 and 16

1. Deploy `wtfd-operative-preview-v16` to the existing Operative preview Worker repository.
2. Wait for Cloudflare to complete that deployment.
3. Deploy `turnout-gear-dashboard-v16` to the standalone dashboard repository.
4. Hard refresh the dashboard.
5. Open Supplies. If quantities are unavailable, open the preview Worker `/probe-supply-inventory` route with the existing bearer token and review the returned source fields.

No new Cloudflare variables or secrets are required. The dashboard derives the supply URL from the existing TURNOUT_GEAR_SOURCE_URL.
